          Variable: true
        Tooltip:
          String: "Replaces the default PBR environment mapping with a simple lookup from a regular texture (no hdr, no roughness, no fresnel, etc.). \\nIt can even be used with unlit materials. The reflection lookup technically assumes a spherical environment map, which is a circular \\nshaped texture as obtained by photographing a mirror ball. However, as a shortcut, it is sometimes used with simple, flat photos, and \\nmanually bent mesh normals. Note: this spherical mapping is technically different from the 'angular' envmap format that looks similar."
        UniqueID:
          String: Simple Reflection
